    "body": "<!-- Thank you for your contribution! Please follow these guidelines to enhance your pull request. If anything is unclear, submit your PR and reach out to maintainers for assistance. Join our Slack community at https://slack.sglang.io to discuss further. -->\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe the purpose and goals of this pull request. -->\r\nI met data corruption on 4\\*A100 `Qwen3-30B-A3B`, and 8\\*L20 `Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507-FP8` when enabling EPLB:\r\n\r\n```\r\npython3 -m sglang.launch_server \\\r\n  --model-path /data/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507-FP8 \\\r\n  --host 0.0.0.0 \\\r\n  --port 30000 \\\r\n  --tp-size 8 \\\r\n  --ep-size 8 \\\r\n  --disable-custom-all-reduce \\\r\n  --enable-eplb \\\r\n  --ep-num-redundant-experts 8 \\\r\n  --eplb-rebalance-num-iterations 100 \\\r\n  --expert-distribution-recorder-mode stat \\\r\n  --log-level info \\\r\n  2>&1 | tee eplb-qwen3-235b.log\r\n\r\n\r\npython3 -m sglang.launch_server \\\r\n  --model-path /mnt/disk4/abc/Qwen3-30B-A3B \\\r\n  --host 0.0.0.0 \\\r\n  --port 30000 \\\r\n  --tp-size 4 \\\r\n  --ep-size 4 \\\r\n  --disable-custom-all-reduce \\\r\n  --enable-eplb \\\r\n  --ep-num-redundant-experts 4 \\\r\n  --eplb-rebalance-num-iterations 100 \\\r\n  --expert-distribution-recorder-mode stat \\\r\n  --expert-balancedness-report-mode server_log \\\r\n  --log-level info \\\r\n  2>&1 | tee eplb.log\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen the prompt's `max_tokens` exceeds the `--eplb-rebalance-num-iterations`, the answer turns to be corrupted at the tail of the output after the rebalance.\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"784\" height=\"137\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc6787a6-7805-4a95-a080-dd502838dc31\" />\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n<!-- Detail the changes made in this pull request. -->\r\n\r\nApply the fix introduced in #18213 to the analogous Qwen3 MoE path by passing\r\nexpert-location dispatch information to `TopK` in `forward_normal()`.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\n<!-- If this pull request affects model outputs (e.g., changes to the kernel or model forward code), provide accuracy test results. -->\r\n\r\n<img width=\"784\" height=\"147\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43c28f24-cb6e-415b-b780-04c79e23dbe6\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\n<!-- If this pull request impacts inference speed, provide benchmarking and profiling results. -->\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\r\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\r\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\r\n- [x] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\r\n- [ ] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\r\n\r\n## Review and Merge Process\r\n\r\n1. Ping Merge Oncalls to start the process. See the [PR Merge Process](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.github/MAINTAINER.md#pull-request-merge-process).\r\n2. Get approvals from [CODEOWNERS](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.github/CODEOWNERS) and other reviewers.\r\n3. Trigger CI tests with [comments](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#how-to-trigger-ci-tests) or contact authorized users to do so.\r\n   - Common commands include `/tag-and-rerun-ci`, `/tag-run-ci-label`, `/rerun-failed-ci`\r\n4. After green CI and required approvals, ask Merge Oncalls or people with Write permission to merge the PR.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38730760295](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38730760295)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38730759956](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38730759956)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38730760066](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38730760066)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
